From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath9k: allow concurrent AP and ad-hoc interfaces

Allow the supported interface combination to include AP and ad-hoc
operation at the same time.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath9k/init.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath9k/init.c
@@ -835,6 +835,7 @@ static const struct ieee80211_iface_limi
 				 BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_AP) },
 	{ .max = 1,	.types = BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_P2P_CLIENT) |
 				 BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_P2P_GO) },
+	{ .max = 1,	.types = BIT(NL80211_IFTYPE_ADHOC) },
 };
 
 #ifdef CPTCFG_ATH9K_CHANNEL_CONTEXT
